# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Real household financial data: NEVER committed (the owner's decision,
# 2026-11-07). These files stay local only; they arrive in
# headroom-handoff.zip. Committed tests use the synthetic fixture
# at packages/core/test/fixtures/household-synthetic.json, and the
# golden tests additionally run against the real seed below
# whenever it exists on the local machine.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
seed/household-nov-2026.json
seed/*.local.json
docs/HANDOFF.md
design/
reference/
headroom-handoff.zip
CLAUDE.MD

